# SPA deep-link fallback for the static demos (Cloudflare Pages).
#
# The demos (participant-portal, application-admin-console) are client-routed SPAs
# staged under /portal-demo/ and /admin-demo/. Reloading a client route such as
# /portal-demo/quests/x has no matching file, so without these rules Cloudflare
# falls through to the root landing index.html — whose asset paths are RELATIVE
# (./styles/main.css), which then 404 under a deep path and render the page
# unstyled. A 200 rewrite serves each SPA's own index.html (its assets are absolute,
# /portal-demo/... , so they resolve) while keeping the URL for the router.
#
# Cloudflare serves existing files first, so real assets under these prefixes are
# unaffected; only non-existent (client-route) paths hit the rewrite.
/portal-demo/*  /portal-demo/index.html  200
/admin-demo/*   /admin-demo/index.html   200
